        "verticalAlign": "middle",
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1 · Hover a wire far from any card: no \"+\" shows. Hover close to one: it fades in. The dock's View section has \"Attachment points: Show on hover / Show all\" to force every \"+\" on for debugging."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a2j4M",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    {
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 700,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:cue-pass",
      "type": "geo",
      "props": {
        "w": 500,
        "h": 260,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "dash": "draw",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1,
        "flipX": false,
        "flipY": false,
        "color": "green",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "size": "m",
        "font": "sans",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "middle",
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "PASS WHEN · only the terminal \"+\" shows at rest and others fade in on approach (or all stay on with the toggle); an Expanded leaf grows the layout with no overlap; Step into swaps the region to MoveToObj's own tree with a working Step out breadcrumb."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a5uEn",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    {
      "x": 40,
      "y": 700,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:cue-step-2",
      "type": "geo",
      "props": {
        "w": 500,
        "h": 220,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "dash": "draw",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1,
        "flipX": false,
        "flipY": false,
        "color": "orange",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "size": "m",
        "font": "sans",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "middle",
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "2 · Click CloseGrip, then in the dock's Node section press the View pill's \"Expanded.\" The card grows to a real frame and the layout reflows around it without overlapping MoveHome."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a3Y4f",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
